{"type":"json_object","message":"I’ll compute the change in the product warranty reserve as the 2006 balance minus the 2005 balance. The source states the reserve was $10 million at Dec. 31, 2006 and $4 million at Dec. 31, 2005, so both inputs are already in USD millions.","tool":"calculate","arguments":{"expression":"warranty_2006 - warranty_2005","variables":{"warranty_2006":{"value":10,"source":"source:q11n3","unit":"USD_million"},"warranty_2005":{"value":4,"source":"source:q11n4","unit":"USD_million"}},"sources":{"warranty_2006":"source:q11n3","warranty_2005":"source:q11n4"}}}